      "writtenOn": "2023-05-04T20:51:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should ignore this result.  I think it means we should ignore the RSSI inside that result.\n\nDo we need to keep the counts separate?  My vote is to simplify this and have a single count unless we need more granularity...  0x7f doesn\u0027t work too well for the index.",
